# Qwen 3 Max — findings by Iceman

- Source: Alibaba / Qwen3 Max (`qwen3-max`, `alibaba/qwen3-max`, `qwen3-max-2025-09-23`)
- Date: 2026-11-14 (UTC), deep second-pass research
- Overview and scoring methodology: `../../model-comparison.md`
- Cross-model signed log: `../../model-findings.md`

## Model card

- **Name:** Qwen3 Max
- **Short description:** Alibaba’s Qwen3 Max is a closed-weights flagship Qwen3 text model for coding agents, complex reasoning, and tool use, now deprecated/superseded by later Qwen Max tiers; verifiable specs/pricing are available but independently verifiable standardized benchmark numerics for comparable scoring were not obtained in this pass.
- **Provider / access:** Alibaba Cloud / hosted providers. models.dev lists multiple providers for `alibaba/qwen3-max`. Local metadata lists `opencode/qwen3-max`, `noFreeId`.
- **Release / knowledge:** models.dev lists release 2025-09-23, knowledge 2025-04, updated 2025-09-23. Artificial Analysis marks the model deprecated and suggests Qwen3 Max Thinking as a newer release.
- **IDs:** `qwen3-max`, `alibaba/qwen3-max`, `qwen3-max-2025-09-23`, `opencode/qwen3-max`.
- **Context window:** 262,144 tokens total; 65,536 max output (models.dev/AA/local metadata).
- **Modalities:** Text input/output.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-14):** Provider-dependent; models.dev shows ~$1.20/$6.00 per 1M in/out on Alibaba and varies by reseller/provider (e.g. lower reseller rates listed). Commercial hosted pricing only (closed weights).
- **Architecture:** Proprietary closed-weights model. Architecture and parameter count not publicly disclosed.

### Raw benchmarks found

> SECOND-PASS SELF-EXCLUSION (updated): I reviewed Artificial Analysis’ Qwen3 Max model page, models.dev model page/API data, OpenRouter model search/API, Hugging Face search (HF model page access returned 401 in this pass), Qwen/Alibaba Cloud pages/searches, and local metadata/prior report. I found verifiable model specs/capabilities/pricing (262K/65K context, text-only, tool calling, temperature, provider pricing ranges, deprecated status) but no independently verifiable, accessible standardized benchmark numerics for this exact model suitable for comparable 1–100 scoring in this pass (AA page showed Intelligence/Cost/Performance as N/A/unknown for the deprecated listing; no SWE-bench/LiveCodeBench/Terminal-Bench/τ-bench/GPQA/HLE/AIME figures were extracted from accessible sources). Local metadata cites AA Intelligence Index 15.6 and HLE 11.9% but these were not independently verified from accessible current sources in this pass. To avoid unverifiable or misattributed scoring, this file remains `.md.excluded` (notes only; scores ignored).

