### Source comparison / conflicts

- **Identity/specs:** AA, models.dev, OpenRouter/search/API references, and local metadata align on Qwen3 Max (`alibaba/qwen3-max`, 262K/65K, text-only, closed weights, deprecated/superseded). models.dev and AA agree on core context/spec attributes.
- **Pricing:** Hosted pricing varies by provider; Alibaba-listed ~$1.20/$6.00 per 1M appears in models.dev/provider data, while resellers show different rates.
- **Benchmarks:** AA deprecated page did not provide populated benchmark/index numerics in accessible extracted content during this pass; local metadata’s cited AA Intelligence Index/HLE figures were not independently re-verified from accessible current sources and are treated as unverified for scoring.
- **Access:** Hugging Face model page fetch returned 401 in this pass; no open-weights artifact verified.

